Package: cpxy
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: firewall4, kmod-nft-nat
Conflicts: cpxy-router
Section: net
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: cpxy-ng
Description: cpxy for OpenWrt: per network, an HTTP proxy and LAN routing with split DNS
 One instance per set of networks, using cpxy or an external SOCKS5 proxy: cpxy-client (HTTP proxy)
 and cpxy-router (kernel IPv4 split with nftables, overseas TCP redirected to cpxy-client, split DNS). Configure /etc/config/cpxy.
